Style0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 인터넷 접수 : 2010. 6. 28(월) ~ 7. 6(화) 09:00 ~ 18:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">서류접수 : 2010. 7. 2(금) ~ 7. 6(화) 09:00 ~ 18:00&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (인터넷 접수자에 한함) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 한국시간 기준이며 토ㆍ일요일 제외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><strong>3. 접수처 및 주소</strong>&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 접수처 : 금오공과대학교 교무연구과 교수지원팀(글로벌관 4층 434호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">주 소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 교무연구과(교수지원팀)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">기타 상세한 사항은&nbsp; 붙임 초빙 공고문 등과 교수초빙 홈페이지를 통해 확인하시고, 문의사항은 본교 교무연구과 교수지원팀으로 하시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 교수채용 담당자 연락처 : 전화 (054)478-7024 / 팩스 (054)478-7034</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">교수초빙 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">교수초빙 홈페이지는 2010년 6월 17일부터 오픈 예정임.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;붙임 1. 교수초빙 공고문</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">본교 교육공무원 임용규정 등</span></p>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림체\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">3. 채용분야별 세부평가기준&nbsp;</span></font>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
